{"id":"2f16ebe8bfe4558f","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-floer-homology.md","title":"Floer Homology","display":"df-floer-homology — Floer Homology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-floer-homology","aliases":["58-df-floer-homology","Floer Homology"],"display":"df-floer-homology — Floer Homology","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-symplectic.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-floer-homology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-floer-homology</span><span>Floer Homology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-floer-homology — Floer Homology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c2477c8e1bc04c16\" href=\"?note=c2477c8e1bc04c16\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-symplectic.md\">../batch16/58-df-symplectic.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\omega)\">\\((M,\\omega)\\)</span> (symplectic manifold) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in V\">\\(P\\in V\\)</span> (chosen generator set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\\in\\mathbb Z^P\">\\(\\mu\\in\\mathbb Z^P\\)</span> (grading) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\mathbb Z_2^{P\\times P}\">\\(N\\in\\mathbb Z_2^{P\\times P}\\)</span> (mod-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span> trajectory-count matrix)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Symplectic}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Symplectic}_S\\)</span> (symplectic predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c2477c8e1bc04c16\" href=\"?note=c2477c8e1bc04c16\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-symplectic.md\">../batch16/58-df-symplectic.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FloerHomologyData}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{FloerHomologyData}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> (algebraic Floer-data predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}floer\\text{-}homology}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FloerHomologyData}_S(CF,\\partial,HF,M,\\omega,P,\\mu,N)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{Symplectic}_S(M,\\omega)\n\\land P\\in V\\land\\mu\\in\\mathbb Z^P\\land N\\in\\mathbb Z_2^{P\\times P}\n\\land CF=\\bigoplus_{x\\in P}\\mathbb Z_2\\cdot x\\land\\partial\\in CF^{CF}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\left(\\partial(x)=\\sum_{\\substack{y\\in P\\\\\\mu(x)-\\mu(y)=1}}N(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\cdot y\\right)\n\\land\\partial\\circ\\partial=0_{CF}\n\\land HF=\\ker(\\partial)/\\operatorname{im}(\\partial).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}floer\\text{-}homology}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FloerHomologyData}_S(CF,\\partial,HF,M,\\omega,P,\\mu,N)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{Symplectic}_S(M,\\omega)\n\\land P\\in V\\land\\mu\\in\\mathbb Z^P\\land N\\in\\mathbb Z_2^{P\\times P}\n\\land CF=\\bigoplus_{x\\in P}\\mathbb Z_2\\cdot x\\land\\partial\\in CF^{CF}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\left(\\partial(x)=\\sum_{\\substack{y\\in P\\\\\\mu(x)-\\mu(y)=1}}N(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\cdot y\\right)\n\\land\\partial\\circ\\partial=0_{CF}\n\\land HF=\\ker(\\partial)/\\operatorname{im}(\\partial).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For Hamiltonian Floer homology, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> is the set of nondegenerate one-periodic orbits, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> is the grading, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\(N(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span> is the mod-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span> count of rigid trajectories determined by the chosen analytic data.</li>\n<li>The boundary counts only index-one generators, and the chain condition <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial^2=0\">\\(\\partial^2=0\\)</span> is explicit before taking homology; no undefined moduli-space symbol carries formal content.</li>\n<li>Arnold conjecture: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#\\mathcal{P}(H) \\geq \\dim H_*(M)\">\\(\\#\\mathcal{P}(H) \\geq \\dim H_*(M)\\)</span></li>\n<li>PSS: connects Floer to Morse homology</li>\n<li>Applications: proof of Arnol'd conjecture, lens space homology</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Audin and Damian, Morse Theory and Floer Homology</li>\n<li>Salamon, Holomorphic Curves and Symplectic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-symplectic.md","status":"resolved","id":"c2477c8e1bc04c16","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-symplectic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-symplectic.md","status":"resolved","id":"c2477c8e1bc04c16","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Symplectic}_S$ (symplectic predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-symplectic.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(M,\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu\\in\\mathbb Z^P","display":false},{"tex":"N\\in\\mathbb Z_2^{P\\times P}","display":false},{"tex":"2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Symplectic}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FloerHomologyData}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}floer\\text{-}homology}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{FloerHomologyData}_S(CF,\\partial,HF,M,\\omega,P,\\mu,N)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\operatorname{Symplectic}_S(M,\\omega)\n\\land P\\in V\\land\\mu\\in\\mathbb Z^P\\land N\\in\\mathbb Z_2^{P\\times P}\n\\land CF=\\bigoplus_{x\\in P}\\mathbb Z_2\\cdot x\\land\\partial\\in CF^{CF}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\left(\\partial(x)=\\sum_{\\substack{y\\in P\\\\\\mu(x)-\\mu(y)=1}}N(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\cdot y\\right)\n\\land\\partial\\circ\\partial=0_{CF}\n\\land HF=\\ker(\\partial)/\\operatorname{im}(\\partial).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"N(\\langle x,y\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"2","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial^2=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\#\\mathcal{P}(H) \\geq \\dim H_*(M)","display":false}],"bytes":1928,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-538","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-floer-homology.md|58-df-floer-homology]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["c2477c8e1bc04c16"]}